   b) Offering a service the value of which entirely or primarily derives from
      the value of pretix or the combined or modified version of pretix,

   c) Offering a service that accomplishes for users the primary purpose of
      pretix or the combined or modified version of pretix,

   d) Using pretix to organize, promote, or sell products or services offered
      or executed by third parties.

2. Pursuant to AGPLv3, Section 7 (b), you are not allowed to remove the
   attribution notice indicating the generated website is built using pretix at
   the bottom of all generated web pages. If you run a modified version of
   pretix, you are allowed to rephrase it to indicate a combined work in a form
   similar to "powered by <Company> based on pretix, source code available at
   <location>". The word pretix must be a link to https://pretix.eu/.

3. Pursuant to AGPLv3, Section 7 (c), if you distribute a modified version in
   source or binary form, or if you offer usage of a modified version to third
   parties (SaaS), it is important to be clear about what kind of modifications
   the distributed work contains. You may not give the impression that the work
   being distributed or the service provided is an authorized or original
   distribution by pretix.

Si este plugin se usa para vender u organizar entradas de terceros, el permiso
adicional del punto 1 no aplica. En ese caso hay que ofrecer el código fuente
de este plugin, bajo esta misma licencia, a quien visite la boletería, con un
enlace visible en el pie junto al enlace de código de pretix.
